# SYNC MARKER prepended by marker.py -- every original timestamp
# shifted +1000 ms. Analyse with: --sync-tone 3000
#
# The marker is NOT part of the session: 600 ms of
# full-brightness white at 40 Hz. Look away until it has passed.
0 40 50 100 255 255 255 15
A 0 3000 0 70 0 1
600 0 50 0 0 0 0 15
A 600 0 0 0 0 1

# ---- original session, timestamps +1000 ms ----
# 17_nondual_awareness_RGB -- PREPARED FOR MEASUREMENT. Not a therapy session.
#
# Keeps 17's exact TIMING skeleton -- every rate, every step instant, the
# carrier sweep, all audio -- and changes only what stops a sensor grading it:
#
#   1. mask 9 + mask 6 merged to mask 15, phase 0. One sensor, all zones in
#      step. The original runs them 180 antiphase at the SAME rate, so a sensor
#      seeing both gets cancellation that looks like a device fault.
#   2. 7 brightness values flattened to a constant 80%. The original
#      fades in from 0 over 15 s and then breathes 8<->22% every 12 s. Both are
#      brightness-only and affect NO timing, but they break measurement twice:
#      a slow fade gives the sync solver no sharp edge, and a moving 8-22%
#      envelope makes the edge detector miss edges -- and a missed edge is
#      indistinguishable from 'the device never fired that event'.
#   3. 10 speech rows removed: speech is broadband and swamps the
#      carrier/beat tracking on the audio channel.
#
# So every timing finding here applies directly to the real session.
#
# 17_nondual_awareness_RGB.ledc — Non-Dual Awareness, RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 17_nondual_awareness. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (steady 7 Hz open hold).
# LEDs on inner ring (mask 9, violet-blue 60,30,200) + outer ring (mask 6, calm blue
# 32,96,255), 180 antiphase, SINE gate — spacious and steady, the slow breathing LFO the
# only movement. Every rate <=10 Hz; brightness <=22%. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]

# --- Brief settle / alpha (beat 10 Hz): vol + light fade in ---
1000 10 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # start: 10 Hz, 80%
A 1000 200 0 >0 0 1 210 0            # binaural: carrier 200 / R210 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
8500 10 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # no-op step
16000 10 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # no-op step
A 31000 200 0 100 0 1 210 0       # alpha settle holds

# --- Descend to the theta-alpha border (beat 10->7) ---
A 151000 >200 0 100 0 1 210 0     # carrier 200->203 (beat 10->7)
151000 >10 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # rate sweep 10 -> 7 Hz begins; audio carrier sweeps with it

# --- Long FLAT open hold (beat 7 Hz, deliberately steady) ---
A 196000 203 0 100 0 1 210 0      # carrier 203 => beat 7 Hz held flat
196000 7 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # steady 7 Hz

# --- Gentle return (beat 7->10) ---
A 781000 >203 0 100 0 1 210 0    # carrier 203->200 (beat 7->10)
781000 >7 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # rate sweep 7 -> 10 Hz begins

# --- Soft close: vol + brightness fade to 0 over 60 s ---
A 871000 200 0 >100 0 1 210 0    # beat alpha 10; vol 50->0
871000 10 50 80 60 30 200 15 1 0   # steady 10 Hz
A 901000 200 0 0 0 1 210 0       # volume 0
901000 10 50 0 60 30 200 15 1 0   # off

